# laguna-s-2.1 + DFlash (Q8_0 drafter, 4-token drafts, drafter window 1024, adaptive 1.2), block-sparse decode, 256K q8_0, ub 4096,
# on the unified build. Chat 36.6 / code 44.4-45.2 tok/s (+4-5% vs the a8c9a4e7c build); needle 15/15 @81K, agentic 5/5 (2026-10-16).
# The default for agent serving; laguna-s-2.1-halo-edit.env adds ngram-mod for copy-heavy edits.
# Set as env vars: GGML_VK_FA_WAVE32=1 GGML_VK_FA_KV_SLICE=4096 GGML_VK_FA_KV_SLICE_MAX_MB=4096 LLAMA_SPARSE_ATTN=64,64,16384
#   DFLASH_SWA=1024 LLAMA_SPEC_ADAPTIVE=1.2 GGML_VK_FA_SPARSE_MIN_RATIO_Q=2
# GGML_VK_FA_KV_SLICE_MAX_MB=4096 is required: the build's default (512) halves prefill at 128K with ub 4096 (311 -> 184 tok/s).
MODEL_SOURCE="-m /models/Laguna-S-2.1-Q4-lean/Laguna-S-2.1-Q4-lean-00001-of-00003.gguf"
MODEL_ALIAS=poolside/Laguna-S-2.1
# MODEL_IMAGE: a llama-server build of llama.cpp 529ac893e + patches/llama.cpp-halo (Vulkan)
MODEL_ARGS="--n-gpu-layers 999 --flash-attn on -fit off --load-mode none --parallel 1 --ctx-size 262144 -ctk q8_0 -ctv q8_0 --ubatch-size 4096 --batch-size 4096 --cache-ram 0 --jinja --temp 1.0 --top-p 1.0 --top-k 20 --min-p 0.0 -md /models/Laguna-S-2.1-UD-Q5_K_XL/laguna-s-2.1-dflash-Q8_0.gguf -ngld 999 --spec-type draft-dflash --spec-draft-n-max 4"
